    {
      "title": "Retry a refund safely",
      "requirements": "The desk can refund part of the credit while another box is still on the way. The payment system sometimes misses an acknowledgment and sends the same refund request again. Use its payment reference to prevent a second payout.\n\nissue_refund(payment, claim, amount_cents) records a payout for a known claim. A payment reference is a nonempty, case-sensitive string. On the first successful call for a reference, the amount must be positive and at most the claim's current refund_due. Add the amount to the paid count, reduce the unpaid credit by the same amount, and return the amount.\n\nIf the reference already succeeded for the same claim and amount, return that amount again even if the claim now has no credit. Leave all balances unchanged. If it succeeded for a different claim or amount, return None and leave both claims unchanged. For any other failure return None. A failed request does not reserve its payment reference.\n\nrefund_paid(claim) returns the total paid on that claim, or None if the claim is unknown. The total starts at 0. refund_due still returns the unpaid credit. A later inspection adds more credit. A payout never changes stock or inspection counts.",
      "visible": [
        {
          "id": "Refund today's box and pay the rest later",
          "kind": "state",
          "steps": [
            {"method":"record_sale","args":["R-620","clamp-lamp",2,1299],"expected":true},
            {"method":"request_return","args":["RA-170","R-620","clamp-lamp",2],"expected":true},
            {"method":"authorize_return","args":["RA-170",2],"expected":true},
            {"method":"receive_parcel","args":["BOX-370","RA-170",1],"expected":true},
            {"method":"inspect_units","args":["BOX-370",1,0],"expected":true},
            {"method":"issue_refund","args":["PAY-371","RA-170",700],"expected":700},
            {"method":"refund_due","args":["RA-170"],"expected":599},
            {"method":"receive_parcel","args":["BOX-381","RA-170",1],"expected":true},
            {"method":"inspect_units","args":["BOX-381",0,1],"expected":true},
            {"method":"refund_due","args":["RA-170"],"expected":1898},
            {"method":"issue_refund","args":["PAY-382","RA-170",1898],"expected":1898},
            {"method":"refund_due","args":["RA-170"],"expected":0},
            {"method":"refund_paid","args":["RA-170"],"expected":2598}
          ]
        },
        {
